# p_c9d4 — Driver commuter; umbrella and bike gear never leave (fork of p_a4f7)

Fork of p_a4f7. The umbrella_elena OUT_OF_HOUSE block (weekday 8–17.5 h) failed in every document that carried it: 0.11 on 4 sightings, meaning the robot looked at entry_floor_e1 four times during work hours and found the umbrella there each time. The per-hour data is conclusive: umbrella_elena is at entry_floor_e1 at every single hourly pass from 00:00 through 22:00, weekdays and weekends alike. Elena does not take the umbrella to work; it stays in the entry. I have removed the OUT_OF_HOUSE block entirely and set the umbrella to entry_floor_e1 "almost_always" 24/7. I also added a claim to test this directly. Everything else (helmet at entry hook, bike lock at entry table, charger at desk, laptop out during work) is inherited unchanged from p_a4f7.

